<title>USA: Scudder names Maliz Beams director of retail funds.</title>
<headline>Scudder names Maliz Beams director of retail funds.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scudder, Stevens &amp; Clark Inc on Monday said it named Maliz Beams director of Scudder Funds Retail, where she will oversee 42 open-end, no-load funds with more than $22 billion in assets.</p>
<p>Beams, 40, joins Scudder from Fleet Investment Management, where she was managing director for strategy and business development and institutional and retail marketing.</p>
</text>
